---
import { ShieldCheck, MessageCircle, ArrowUpRight } from "lucide-astro";
---

<section class="bg-white py-32 md:py-48 relative">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 text-center flex flex-col items-center">
    
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-black/5 bg-gray-50 mb-10">
      <ShieldCheck class="w-4 h-4 text-[#B61F1F]" />
      <span class="text-black text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
        Guía Informativa SCTR
      </span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-black text-5xl md:text-7xl font-extrabold mb-8 leading-[1.05] tracking-tight max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      ¿Qué es el SCTR y cuándo es <span class="text-[#B61F1F]">obligatorio</span> en Perú?
    </h1>

    <p class="text-gray-500 text-xl md:text-2xl mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-medium">
      Todo lo que necesitas saber sobre el Seguro Complementario de Trabajo de Riesgo para operar bajo la normativa vigente.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-6 w-full sm:w-auto">
      <a 
        href="/cotizar" 
        class="group w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 bg-[#B61F1F] text-white px-10 py-5 font-bold text-base transition-all rounded-lg hover:bg-black"
      >
        Cotizar mi SCTR Ahora
        <ArrowUpRight size={20} class="group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1 transition-transform" />
      </a>

      <a 
        href="https://wa.me/..." 
        target="_blank" 
        class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-3 border-2 border-black text-black px-10 py-5 font-bold text-base hover:bg-black hover:text-white transition-all rounded-lg"
      >
        Asesoría por WhatsApp
        <MessageCircle size={20} />
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  h1 {
    font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  p, span, a {
    font-family: 'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
</style>